<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to reveal October exports Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Brazil to reveal October exports Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Ministry of Industry and Commerce will reveal exports for the month of October at 1300 local/1500 GMT Tuesday, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Exports up to the end of the fourth week of the month totalled $3.57 billion.</p>
<p>In September, overseas sales were $4.115 billion, resulting in a trade deficit for that month of $655 million.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
